  "body": "# oh-my-claudecode v5.6.1: Maintenance Release\n\n## Release Notes\n\nMaintenance release with internal improvements.\n\n### Stats\n\n- **1 PR merged** | **0 new features** | **0 bug fixes** | **0 security/hardening improvements** | **0 other changes**\n\n### Install / Update\n\nThe npm CLI and the Claude Code marketplace/plugin are separate install tracks, not either/or replacements. Update whichever track you use; if you have both installed, update both. CLI-dependent skill paths such as `ask` and CLI-backed `team` require the `omc` CLI from the npm package.\n\n**CLI / runtime:**\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g oh-my-claude-sisyphus@5.6.1\n```\n\n**Claude Code plugin:**\n\n```text\n/plugin marketplace update omc\n```\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode/compare/v5.6.0...v5.6.1\n"
